-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",49,{
[1537]="700032D6\n1\tCollect prickly broom leaves (total: 4)\tPrickly broom grows along the water, south-east of Budgeford. Wilimar has decided to provide Callum with bandages for his wound, but to aid in his healing, he wants to soak the bandages in an unguent made from prickly broom leaves. He has asked you to gather these leaves for him.\n2\tBring prickly broom leaves to Wilimar Bolger\tWilimar Bolger can be found near his hole on the north-west side of Budgeford. Wilimar has decided to provide Callum with bandages for his wound, but to aid in his healing, he wants to soak the bandages in an unguent made from prickly broom leaves. He has asked you to gather these leaves for him.\n3\tBring bandages to Callum\tCallum's camp is on the far west side of the Frogmoors, west of Budgeford. With the prickly broom leaves you gathered, Wilimar was able to prepare an unguent in which to soak the bandages. In addition to giving the bandages to Callum, Wilimar has asked you to tell Callum that he holds no malice against him and hopes he will do the same.\n",
[1538]="7000E3D9\n1\tDefeat Iarvael\tYou must hunt down and defeat Iarvael, who is laired in the hills north of Bail Dílas.\n2\tTalk to Handarod\tTell Handarod in Esteldín of your victory in Angmar.\n",
[1539]="7004D710\n1\tTalk to King Thranduil\tKing Thranduil can be found in Felegoth. King Thranduil has asked you to accompany him and his warriors to Torech Emel in an effort to put an end to the blight of Iphantemel.\n2\tTalk to King Thranduil\tKing Thranduil can be found in Felegoth. You have defeated Iphantemel and forever banished her blight from Eryn Lasgalen. You should talk to King Thranduil.\n",
[1540]="700479DD\n1\tEnter Dûm Boha\tYou should find the Haradrim encampment of Dûm Boha, located on the western slopes of the Slag-hills.\n2\tDefeat Rujateng\030Complete Quest: The Eyes and The Blind\030Complete Quest: Beneath the Snake\030Complete Quest: Dwindling Rations\030Complete Quest: The Poisoned Mind\tYou should find and defeat Rujateng at Dûm Boha.\n3\tReturn to Gladhir\tYou should return to Gladhir, who can be found at Haerondir.\n",
[1541]="70016B8C\n1\tDestroy Moria siege-engines (total: 3)\030Destroy Moria catapults (total: 3)\tMoria siege-engines and Moria catapults can be found in Drû-garmadh, south-east of Mekhem-bizru. Alrekur fears the siege-weaponry being built in Drû-garmadh and wants you to destroy several siege-engines and catapults.\n2\tTalk to Alrekur in Mekhem-bizru\tAlrekur is in Mekhem-bizru, north-west of Drû-garmadh. Alrekur will be pleased to hear the Moria siege-engines and Moria catapults being built in Drû-garmadh have been destroyed.\n",
[1542]="7000D6B4\n1\tDefeat fell spirits in Imlad Balchorth (total: 10)\tFell spirits may be found in Imlad Balchorth, west of Myrkworth. Sigar has asked you to destroy the fell spirits in Imlad Balchorth. You can find them wandering Imlad Balchorth.\n2\tTalk to Sigar\tSigar is at Myrkworth, east of Imlad Balchorth. Having destroyed the fell spirits as asked, you should return to Sigar in Myrkworth and tell him the deed is done.\n",
[1543]="7006565C\n1\tTalk to Candron through the door\tHeniawen has asked you to reassure Candron that there is no danger in Pelargir. You should talk to him through the door.\n2\tLook at the top of the stairs near the Minardil statue\030Go to the top of the stairs near the Minardil statue\030Look in the district with the destroyed Castamir monument\030Go to the district with the destroyed Castamir monument\030Look in the courtyard of Lord Sirgon's manor\030Go to the courtyard of Lord Sirgon's manor\tCandron has asked you to \"scout\" three places in East Pelargir. He mentioned the district with the destroyed Castamir monument, the top of the stairs near the Minardil statue, and the courtyard of Lord Sirgon's manor.\n3\tTalk to Candron through the door\tYou have \"scouted\" all three places in East Pelargir. You should return to Heniawen in East Pelargir and talk to Candron through the door of their home.\n4\tTalk to Heniawen\tYou have helped Candron find the courage to leave the house. You should talk to Heniawen in East Pelargir.\n",
[1544]="700085D0\n1\tDefeat Iron Crown Spirit-master\tThe necromancers of Imlad Balchorth can be found at the ruins high in the southern hills of the area. The chief sorcerer of the necromancers, the Spirit-master, no doubt controls Deluches, the spirit-captain. Gautar has asked you to defeat him, and thus banish Deluches forever.\n2\tDefeat Deluches\tEithel Úmfaer is in southern Imlad Balchorth, west of Myrkworth. Deluches, captain of the fell spirits, has been summoned to Eithel Úmfaer, the master shrine in Imlad Balchorth, where he must be destroyed.\n3\tTalk to Gautar\tGautar is back at Myrkworth, east and a bit north of Eithel Úmfaer. You have defeated Deluches and banished at least some of the fell spirits of Angmar. You should bring the good tidings to Gautar.\n",
[1545]="7002C014\n1\tDefeat Brúngwath at Atburg\tBrúngwath is at Atburg, south-east of Aculf's camp in the Rushgore. Bagmund has asked you to drive Brúngwath from the Rushgore, in hopes that the shades will not return.\n2\tTalk to Bagmund at Aculf's camp in the Rushgore\tBagmund is at Aculf's camp in the Rushgore, north-west of Atburg. Eowils told you to return to Bagmund and let him know that you have dealt with Brúngwath.\n",
[1546]="7001E7EC\n1\tDefeat fell spirits (total: 10)\030Defeat Umhen\tUmhen's isle lies to the south of Barad Angol, at the centre of the Bleakmere. Faerchiril has asked you to seek out and defeat the fell spirit Umhen and his minions.\n2\tTalk to Faerchiril\tFaerchiril is at Barad Angol due north of Umhen's isle, up the mountain. You should return to Faerchiril and let her know that Umhen and his minions have been defeated.\n",
[1547]="70040E06\n1\tReplace banners of Umbar with banners of Gondor (total: 8)\tBanners of Umbar fly in Hashadîr, the Corsair camp south-west of Dol Amroth in Belfalas. You should replace the Corsairs' banners with Gondorian ones.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have littered Hashadîr with the flags of Gondor, which will do much to dishearten the Corsairs who have begun to raid these southern lands.\n",
[1548]="70030CB3\n1\tEnter the field\tThe rock is south of Cliving. Gladsnel asked you to throw a spear through several shields on Orc-banners planted at Norcrofts farms.\n2\tHit the north banner's shield\030Hit the east banner's shield\030Hit the west banner's shield\030Hit the south banner's shield\tThe four farms are spread out to the north, east, and west of the rock. Gladsnel asked you to throw a spear through four shields on Orc-banners. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTalk to Gladsnel\tGladsnel is in Cliving. Gladsnel will be pleased to hear that a spear was thrown through each of the four shields.\n",
[1549]="70026587\n1\tBurn banners of the Iron Crown (total: 6)\tOrchalwë wants you to burn the banners of the Iron Crown in the courtyard.\n2\tTalk to Orchalwë\tOrchalwë will want to talk about the burning of the banners.\n",
[1550]="7004AD11\n1\tDestroy banners of the Stained (total: 10)\tBanners of the Stained can be found in Seregost's courtyards and terraces. You should destroy banners of the Stained.\n",
[1551]="70015E44\n1\tTalk to Rostoriel at Echad Dúnann\030Collect banners (total: 12)\tThe Redhorn Gate is north-east of Echad Dúnann. Rostoriel has asked you to remove half-orc banners from the Redhorn Gate.\n",
[1552]="70019388\n1\tGalhíril can be found near the gate to Imlad Lalaith. Aesbrennil and Hadhelen can be found within the Vineyards of Lórien, south of Imlad Lalaith. Glasnír can be found at the entrance to the vineyards, south of Imlad Lalaith. Maliriel has asked you to help her and her companions to complete all the preparations for the upcoming feast.\t\n2\tTalk to Maliriel at Imlad Lalaith\tMaliriel is at Imlad Lalaith. You should report to Maliriel that all the banquet preparations she asked you to finish are complete.\n",
[1553]="70053E73\n1\tDestroy Orc weapons and vile supplies in Banám Lugaun\tOrc weapons and vile supplies can be found in Banám Lugaun in Rath Dúath. You should destroy Orc weapons and vile supplies in Banám Lugaun.\n2\tDestroy Orc weapons (total: 8)\030Destroy vile supplies (total: 12)\tOrc weapons and vile supplies can be found in Banám Lugaun in Rath Dúath. You should destroy Orc weapons and vile supplies in Banám Lugaun.\n3\tCompleted\tDestroyed many Orc weapons and vile supplies in Banám Lugaun.\n",
[1554]="70053E70\n1\tIntercept orders from an Orc in Banám Lugaun\tAn Orc in Banám Lugaun must be carrying orders. You should intercept Orc orders in Banám Lugaun.\n2\tIntercept Orc orders in Banám Lugaun\tThere must be at least one Orc in Banám Lugaun carrying orders. You should intercept Orc orders in Banám Lugaun.\n3\tDestroy the Orc orders in a fire pit\tFire pits can be found in Banám Lugaun. You should destroy the orders in a fire pit.\n4\tCompleted\tDestroyed the Orc orders.\n",
[1555]="70053E72\n1\tDefeat Orcs and Uruk-hai in Banám Lugaun\tOrcs and Uruk-hai can be found in Banám Lugaun in Rath Dúath. You should defeat Orcs and Uruk-hai in Banám Lugaun.\n2\tDefeat Orcs (total: 10)\030Defeat Laugshat\030Defeat Uruk-hai (total: 6)\tOrcs and Uruk-hai can be found in Banám Lugaun in Rath Dúath. You should defeat Orcs and Uruk-hai in Banám Lugaun.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeat many Orcs and Uruk-hai in Banám Lugaun.\n",
[1556]="70026745\n1\tTalk to Barachen at his camp in the Trollshaws\tBarachen's camp is far to the east of Evendim, in the Trollshaws, just beyond the Last Bridge from the Lone-lands. Orchalwë has asked you to speak with his friend Barachen.\n",
[1557]="7001D1C7\n1\tSearch for notable objects\030Search for any curious relics\030Search amongst book-shelves\tThe relics and tomes of the Necromancer can be found throughout Barad Guldur. You should keep an eye out for any useful clues or information that will aid the efforts of the Malledhrim as you ascend Barad Guldur.\n2\tTalk to Anglú in Barad Guldur\tAnglú awaits you in Barad Guldur. You should hasten back to Anglú and tell him of your findings throughout the tower.\n",
[1558]="7001D1CF\n1\tEstablish a staging point in Barad Guldur\tBarad Guldur is the mighty tower at the fortress of Dol Guldur. Once inside, Belvaer has asked you to sever the flow of enemy reinforcements streaming from the tower. Belvaer seems to think that the captain of the guard should be found soon after beginning your ascent of the tower.\n2\tTalk to Anglú in Barad Guldur\tAnglú is in Barad Guldur. You should speak with the Elf-lieutenant Anglú for further instruction on your offensive.\n",
[1559]="7001E5D6\n1\tTalk to Belvaer at Dol Guldur\tBelvaer stands below at Dol Guldur. You should speak with Belvaer and show him the remnants of the Nazgûl you slew.\n2\tTalk to Celeborn in Caras Galadhon\tCeleborn is in Caras Galadhon, his fair Elven-home in Lothlórien. Belvaer gave you a coin to present to Celeborn along with the tattered robes of the Nazgûl you slew.\n",
[1560]="70042F28\n1\tDefeat Orcs and Goblins at Barad Nemorn\tBarad Nemorn is located near where the Morgulduin meets the Anduin in Southern Ithilien. You should defeat Orcs and Golbins at Barad Nemorn to decimate the ranks.\n2\tDefeat Orcs and Goblins at Barad Nemorn (total: 12)\tBarad Nemorn is located near where the Morgulduin meets the Anduin in Southern Ithilien. You should defeat Orcs and Golbins at Barad Nemorn to decimate the ranks.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated Orcs and Goblins at Barad Nemorn.\n",
[1561]="70042F25\n1\tDestroy statues of Sauron at Barad Nemorn\tBarad Nemorn is located near where the Morgulduin meets the Anduin in Southern Ithilien. You should destroy statues of the Dark Lord at Barad Nemorn to strike a blow to the camp's morale.\n2\tDestroy statues of Sauron (total: 10)\tBarad Nemorn is located near where the Morgulduin meets the Anduin in Southern Ithilien. You should destroy statues of the Dark Lord at Barad Nemorn to strike a blow to the camp's morale.\n3\tCompleted\tDestroyed statues of Sauron.\n",
[1562]="70042F2C\n1\tTake teeth from defeated trolls at Barad Nemorn\tBarad Nemorn is located near where the Morgulduin meets the Anduin in Southern Ithilien. You should take teeth from trolls you defeat in Barad Nemorn to show the Morgul-host that their enemies are fell and fearless.\n2\tCollect teeth from trolls at Barad Nemorn (total: 4)\tBarad Nemorn is located near where the Morgulduin meets the Anduin in Southern Ithilien. You should take teeth from trolls you defeat in Barad Nemorn to show the Morgul-host that their enemies are fell and fearless.\n3\tBring the troll teeth to a Ranger at Faramir's Look-out\tFaramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath. You should bring the troll teeth to a Ranger at Faramir's Look-out.\n",
[1563]="70042F2F\n1\tDefeat the leaders of Barad Nemorn\tBarad Nemorn is located near where the Morgulduin meets the Anduin in Southern Ithilien. You should defeat the leaders of Barad Nemorn.\n2\tDefeat Muzgásh\030Defeat Dagron\tBarad Nemorn is located near where the Morgulduin meets the Anduin in Southern Ithilien. You should defeat the leaders of Barad Nemorn.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated the leaders of Barad Nemorn.\n",
[1564]="70042F2E\n1\tDefeat Warg Masters at Barad Nemorn\tBarad Nemorn is located near where the Morgulduin meets the Anduin in Southern Ithilien. You should defeat Warg Masters at Barad Nemorn to prevent the Wargs from becoming battle-ready.\n2\tDefeat Warg Masters at Barad Nemorn (total: 4)\tBarad Nemorn is located near where the Morgulduin meets the Anduin in Southern Ithilien. You should defeat Warg Masters at Barad Nemorn to prevent the Wargs from becoming battle-ready.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated Warg Masters.\n",
[1565]="70066588\n1\tDefeat Darkwaters at Gaerlond (total: 8)\030Cleanse ash mounds (total: 6)\tGarvir has asked you to assist in the cleansing of Gaerlond to the north-east. Fell creatures have been sighted and are scaring the workers.\n2\tTalk to Garvir\tYou should report your success at Gaerlond to Garvir. Garvir can be found at Barad Rill.\n3\tTalk to Herion at Parth Rest\tGarvir told you that Herion once again needs your help. You should talk to Herion at Parth Rest. Parth Rest can be found to the north.\n",
[1566]="7004A33E\n1\tCollect ancient tomes\tCollect ancient tomes.\n2\tCollect ancient tomes (total: 8)\tCollect ancient tomes.\n3\tBring the ancient tomes to Candúr\tBring the ancient tomes to Candúr.\n",
[1567]="7004A33A\n1\tDefeat Kathanûl\tDefeat Kathanûl.\n2\tTalk to Candúr\tYou should return to Candúr and apprise him of your efforts.\n",
[1568]="7004A33F\n1\tDefeat Black Númenóreans in Barad-dûr\tDefeat Black Númenóreans in Barad-dûr.\n2\tDefeat Black Númenóreans in Barad-dûr (total: 15)\tDefeat Black Númenóreans in Barad-dûr.\n3\tTalk to Candúr\tTalk to Candúr.\n",
})
